{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-1145","title":{"zh":"扫描完毕","en":"Scan Complete"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/5ff4a6f2439fb8cd99e7.webp","start":"first_contact.1145","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的活动举办时间远超预期。\n\n乘坐太空梭返回后，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]汇报了行动大获成功。不仅这种外星语言被大部分破解了，我们的扫描也揭示了他们科技能力的清晰图景。\n\n这将会极大地促进我们与[This.ContactCountry.GetName]未来的关系，同时还让他们对我们对他们科技了如指掌一事蒙在鼓里。","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName]'s event lasted much longer than expected.\n\nWhen [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName]'s shuttle returned, they reported that the operation was a success. Not only did they successfully decipher most of the alien language"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.1145","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.1145","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"扫描完毕","en":"Scan Complete"},"texts":[{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的活动举办时间远超预期。\n\n乘坐太空梭返回后，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]汇报了行动大获成功。不仅这种外星语言被大部分破解了，我们的扫描也揭示了他们科技能力的清晰图景。\n\n这将会极大地促进我们与[This.ContactCountry.GetName]未来的关系，同时还让他们对我们对他们科技了如指掌一事蒙在鼓里。","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName]'s event lasted much longer than expected.\n\nWhen [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName]'s shuttle returned, they reported that the operation was a success. Not only did they successfully decipher most of the alien language, but our scan has given us a clear picture of their technological capabilities.\n\nThis will greatly enhance further relations with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName], without them being aware of our understanding of their scientific knowledge."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/5ff4a6f2439fb8cd99e7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":